    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/1b9f7f357e12def240ce046a2277d255.avif?t=1743465065\" width=385 height=135 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A POV-Style Text Adventure in an Original World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1549, as shadows loom once more over St. Godhrkar, diverse souls are thrust into the spotlight. As both narrator and creator, you wield the power to rewrite fate by uncovering lies woven into the story. Will you seek redemption, embrace destruction, or remain a bystander? Where stories <strong>lie</strong>, the answer waits for your gaze. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/3f41d14935b9662b2ef4f04d1610d7b9.poster.avif?t=1743465065\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/3f41d14935b9662b2ef4f04d1610d7b9.webm?t=1743465065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/3f41d14935b9662b2ef4f04d1610d7b9.mp4?t=1743465065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/a54a68879bc044e9596d4f2c6f02bc0f.avif?t=1743465065\" width=385 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five years after the story of Knell of St. Godhrkar, the Silent Act has plunged Promland \u2014 a land once renowned for its symphonies\u2014into eerie silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey between two contrasting cities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thalizac</strong>, an ancient holy city from the prequel, now suffocated under surveillance and oppression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moarta</strong>, a cinematic city rising from chaos, where the dawn of &quot;talking pictures&quot; sparks another silent revolution...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the crossroads of their destinies, you\u2019ll unravel layered deceptions and unearth truths capable of reshaping the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/493c101ea266b71aee525123ebd2c683.avif?t=1743465065\" width=385 height=135 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Original Worldbuilding</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience voice acting and songs based on an originally created language.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/0c136c8318850806239f2f8aea964094.poster.avif?t=1743465065\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/0c136c8318850806239f2f8aea964094.webm?t=1743465065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/0c136c8318850806239f2f8aea964094.mp4?t=1743465065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Multi-Perspective Narrative</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide 3 protagonists and 4 supporting characters toward your chosen endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/f77674b2358b5d02893b1702757d35ae.poster.avif?t=1743465065\" width=800 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/f77674b2358b5d02893b1702757d35ae.webm?t=1743465065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/f77674b2358b5d02893b1702757d35ae.mp4?t=1743465065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Cinematic Panel System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive audiovisual storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/a405d017cccd50d7b194cab210d763b6.poster.avif?t=1743465065\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/a405d017cccd50d7b194cab210d763b6.webm?t=1743465065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/a405d017cccd50d7b194cab210d763b6.mp4?t=1743465065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/b89ea44a7da8f3b8f0a795f95f142991.poster.avif?t=1743465065\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/b89ea44a7da8f3b8f0a795f95f142991.webm?t=1743465065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/b89ea44a7da8f3b8f0a795f95f142991.mp4?t=1743465065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Lie Detection Mechanic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character might deceive you. Uncover falsehoods to earn &quot;Truth Points,&quot; which let you alter critical decisions and steer the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/37f3a8149b5011d8fdc3271a53c9542e.poster.avif?t=1743465065\" width=800 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/37f3a8149b5011d8fdc3271a53c9542e.webm?t=1743465065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/37f3a8149b5011d8fdc3271a53c9542e.mp4?t=1743465065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/2adc816c56a5b9482b937b41fb8b9b5d.avif?t=1743465065\" width=385 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/87a3e9f74e928456eba4d467a34727b0.avif?t=1743465065\" width=250 height=347 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\uff1f\uff1f\uff1f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nameless man wandering the streets of Moata, his name, origins, and past all shrouded in mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/dc7a92687c89607bdc7533b1a34740e6.avif?t=1743465065\" width=250 height=347 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grenearl Demyon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A student at St. Godhrkar Seminary, naturally shy and rule-abiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/945105c4d55f1cb54f79705d3be58180.avif?t=1743465065\" width=250 height=347 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evgenia Byaidriski</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cherished youngest daughter of a borderland noble family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/7bb6ce30ebb052340d715b91c6bacd7d.avif?t=1743465065\" width=250 height=347 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Priscilla\u00a0Sykshee</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A middle-school student and ex-choir lead at St. Godhrkar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/768205929fe1497f5bbab7583abd24f6.avif?t=1743465065\" width=250 height=347 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tushev Byaidriski</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A conservative noble from Hokuriqa, and the Marquis of the Border Fraata.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/aed6e18c30a857ce63d146bc095b86cd.avif?t=1743465065\" width=250 height=347 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chouchu</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shrewd and calculating woman with a flair for the dramatic. Often seen in garish, eye-catching attire, Chouchu has a reputation for being both cunning and resourceful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/c04a271ce12d3db0018db6e3b303d688.avif?t=1743465065\" width=385 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Director/Art/Story/Programming: Birctreel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Writers: Birctreel, \u6211\u8981\u957f\u9ad8, \u6fef\u89c4, \u5c0f\u8682\u8681</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: Dzmitry Paulau, Erika Kopyan, Francesco Mattei, Ivan K</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Testers: Birctreel, \u63d0\u5251\u7684\u4eba, \u5927\u5403\u8d27\u7403\u5b50</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596750/extras/1240d89482bbbd11d81fe1be06f71ccf.avif?t=1743465065\" width=770 height=770 /></span></p>",
